      "side": 1,
      "message": "Controlling cgroup needs CAP_SYS_ADMIN which VS already inherits from init.\n\nIn addition, file-level to /sys/fs/cgrouop/* files are allowed to \u0027domain\u0027 already.\n https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/sepolicy/private/domain.te;drc\u003d2ffeca72a639d3a8c7adf80dd7f7abd26546ab47;l\u003d60",
